WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:04.390
Our government's always
controlled our content.

00:00:04.390 --> 00:00:05.580
The fight for freedom.

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:07.016
We've just never paid attention.

00:00:07.016 --> 00:00:08.680
Freedom of speech.

00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:11.680
There's a very small group of people,

00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:15.473
that influence all the
companies that we watch.

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:19.840
That's why we have Q, patriots everywhere,

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:21.470
stand at the ready.

00:00:21.470 --> 00:00:22.810
Q is completely baseless.

00:00:22.810 --> 00:00:25.480
It's the rantings and
ravings of anonymous people

00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:26.313
who we don't know,

00:00:26.313 --> 00:00:27.150
it may be multiple people,

00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:28.070
It may be different people,

00:00:28.070 --> 00:00:29.520
It may be one person.

00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:31.190
Q has not foretold anything

00:00:31.190 --> 00:00:34.850
despite the fact that many
people who are believers in Q

00:00:34.850 --> 00:00:37.890
will try to convince you through
different signals and small

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:39.310
things that you might not have picked up,

00:00:39.310 --> 00:00:41.360
that it actually is all true.

00:00:41.360 --> 00:00:42.440
You know, it's not true.

00:00:42.440 --> 00:00:43.590
This is insane.

00:00:43.590 --> 00:00:47.050
QAnon offers a constantly shifting way

00:00:47.050 --> 00:00:49.470
to view the world as it's happening,

00:00:49.470 --> 00:00:52.160
which means that it's very
easy for people who believe it,

00:00:52.160 --> 00:00:58.040
to then discard any attempt to
reason with them and explain

00:00:58.040 --> 00:00:59.490
why they shouldn't believe it.

00:00:59.490 --> 00:01:02.225
It's almost seeped into the
groundwater of the internet now.

00:01:02.225 --> 00:01:04.755
Google, lied to you!

00:01:06.006 --> 00:01:08.006
Facebook, lied to you!

00:01:09.410 --> 00:01:11.790
You know, for a long time reporters

00:01:11.790 --> 00:01:14.640
have been trying and have
been openly wondering

00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:15.560
who is Q?

00:01:15.560 --> 00:01:17.570
Who is this anonymous
person making the posts.

00:01:17.570 --> 00:01:20.050
It's one letter, but it spells out

00:01:20.050 --> 00:01:22.060
a bizarre conspiracy theory

00:01:22.060 --> 00:01:24.280
with President Trump at the center.

00:01:24.280 --> 00:01:26.640
Obviously, the president
knows what QAnon is.

00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:28.910
Well, I don't know much about
the movement other than I

00:01:28.910 --> 00:01:30.730
understand they like me very much.

00:01:30.730 --> 00:01:34.600
Almost equally, as important
as to whoever Q is,

00:01:34.600 --> 00:01:37.266
is who runs these sites like
QMAP? 

00:01:37.266 --> 00:01:38.250
People like this are just

00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:41.420
as influential in spreading the
conspiracy as Q themselves.

00:01:41.420 --> 00:01:43.360
Q is a pretty interesting case study

00:01:43.360 --> 00:01:44.680
in how you move a

00:01:44.680 --> 00:01:47.740
fringe idea into the mainstream.

00:01:47.740 --> 00:01:52.100
I had a personal curiosity
as to who was behind QMAP before.

00:01:52.100 --> 00:01:53.700
You know, I really felt that it

00:01:53.700 --> 00:01:57.340
warranted kind of a deeper investigation.

00:01:57.340 --> 00:01:59.910
The place to start was
to go and talk to him.

00:01:59.910 --> 00:02:02.308
So I rented a car and I
drove out to New Jersey.

00:02:11.140 --> 00:02:12.230
My name is William Turton,

00:02:12.230 --> 00:02:15.080
I'm a cybersecurity
reporter at Bloomberg News.

00:02:15.080 --> 00:02:16.190
I'm Joshua Brustein,

00:02:16.190 --> 00:02:19.870
I'm a writer for Bloomberg News
and Businessweek magazine.

00:02:19.870 --> 00:02:23.753
I'm one of the two writers on
the story about QMAP.pub.

00:02:25.890 --> 00:02:29.340
Jason Gelinas is a pretty
normal sounding guy.

00:02:29.340 --> 00:02:32.370
He is a dad in New Jersey,

00:02:32.370 --> 00:02:35.330
three children lives in Berkeley Heights,

00:02:35.330 --> 00:02:38.850
which is a town about an hour
outside of New York City.

00:02:38.850 --> 00:02:41.330
Jason, in many ways was
your typical American.

00:02:41.330 --> 00:02:42.990
He got a degree,

00:02:42.990 --> 00:02:46.450
he went into working in the
technology departments of

00:02:46.450 --> 00:02:47.390
different banks.

00:02:47.390 --> 00:02:51.266
He was a senior employee at
Citibank where he managed over a

00:02:51.266 --> 00:02:52.770
hundred employees, and you know,

00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:54.290
the last major project he worked on,

00:02:54.290 --> 00:02:57.100
there was an artificial
intelligence project at Citi.

00:03:02.720 --> 00:03:05.830
Jason Gelinas also ran one of the,

00:03:05.830 --> 00:03:09.100
if not the biggest QAnon conspiracy website.

00:03:11.110 --> 00:03:15.220
Like many people who are
now deeply into QAnon,

00:03:15.220 --> 00:03:20.860
Jason seemed to express the
beginnings of interest in these

00:03:20.860 --> 00:03:23.653
kind of theories during
the Obama administration.

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:27.790
We were able to speak to friends,

00:03:27.790 --> 00:03:29.820
one of whom told us that, you know,

00:03:29.820 --> 00:03:32.300
about the time Obama was elected,

00:03:32.300 --> 00:03:35.540
Jason described Obama to
him as the antichrist.

00:03:35.540 --> 00:03:37.450
He seemed to have a lot
of anger towards the Obama

00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:41.890
administration and began to
explore some unconventional

00:03:41.890 --> 00:03:43.360
shall we say beliefs.

00:03:43.360 --> 00:03:46.070
One of them related to the idea that

00:03:46.070 --> 00:03:49.603
Hillary Clinton was
involved in sex trafficking.

00:03:51.970 --> 00:03:53.240
You know, we don't know for sure

00:03:53.240 --> 00:03:55.520
if Jason believed in 'Pizzagate' as

00:03:55.520 --> 00:03:56.800
it's formerly known,

00:03:56.800 --> 00:03:59.860
but friends told us that he
believed in this idea that

00:03:59.860 --> 00:04:01.300
powerful Democratic officials,

00:04:01.300 --> 00:04:03.460
including Hillary Clinton
were involved in the sex

00:04:03.460 --> 00:04:04.620
trafficking of children.

00:04:04.620 --> 00:04:06.560
But this all goes back to
Russian hackers leaking John

00:04:06.560 --> 00:04:08.550
Podesta's emails, you
might recall those were

00:04:08.550 --> 00:04:11.220
posted on WikiLeaks and users on

00:04:11.220 --> 00:04:15.380
the image board 4chan started
reading those emails and

00:04:15.380 --> 00:04:19.590
decided that the word pizza
meant children and kind of

00:04:19.590 --> 00:04:22.480
worked themselves up into this
idea that in the basement of

00:04:22.480 --> 00:04:25.080
a pizza shop in DC, were secret tunnels,

00:04:25.080 --> 00:04:27.500
leading to Congress, where
they're sex trafficking children.

00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:30.620
One of the big surprises of
the presidential campaign was

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:34.320
the explosion of fake
news on the internet.

00:04:34.320 --> 00:04:37.640
Fantastic tales that
some believe to be true.

00:04:37.640 --> 00:04:40.530
At one point far into
the conspiracy theory,

00:04:40.530 --> 00:04:42.100
someone actually showed up there with,

00:04:42.100 --> 00:04:45.960
with an assault rifle and
shot it inside the restaurant.

00:04:45.960 --> 00:04:49.700
Before realizing that the
basement he was looking for that

00:04:49.700 --> 00:04:53.500
would have presumably held the
children did not even exist.

00:04:53.500 --> 00:04:56.891
28-year-old Edgar Welch was
arrested in Washington

00:04:56.891 --> 00:04:59.450
Sunday afternoon, outside Comet Ping Pong,

00:04:59.450 --> 00:05:01.550
a popular family pizza parlor,

00:05:01.550 --> 00:05:04.710
D.C. police say Welch fired
at least one round into the

00:05:04.710 --> 00:05:08.120
restaurant floor with an
AR-15 rifle like this one

00:05:08.120 --> 00:05:09.670
on his Facebook page.

00:05:09.670 --> 00:05:11.240
He recently pleaded guilty,

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:12.910
but this became a huge phenomenon,

00:05:12.910 --> 00:05:15.003
which kind of set the stage for QAnon.

00:05:19.480 --> 00:05:21.668
So Q drops as they're called,

00:05:21.668 --> 00:05:24.280
are posted to this
website called 8kun,

00:05:24.280 --> 00:05:25.730
which is formerly called 8chan.

00:05:25.730 --> 00:05:27.590
They were formerly posted on 4chan

00:05:27.590 --> 00:05:29.410
and they can come daily,

00:05:29.410 --> 00:05:31.803
a few days apart or multiple times a day.

00:05:33.200 --> 00:05:35.260
In October 2017,

00:05:35.260 --> 00:05:40.040
a anonymous user who called
themselves Q posted a message

00:05:40.040 --> 00:05:43.900
saying that Hillary
Clinton would be arrested,

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:46.920
that this would lead to planned riots.

00:05:46.920 --> 00:05:47.960
And that this would kind of be

00:05:47.960 --> 00:05:50.690
the beginning of the apocalypse.

00:05:50.690 --> 00:05:52.710
Now, this sounds really weird.

00:05:52.710 --> 00:05:55.590
It wasn't actually all
that unusual for 4chan

00:05:55.590 --> 00:05:56.433
at the time.

00:05:56.433 --> 00:05:59.710
There were
a fair number of posts

00:05:59.710 --> 00:06:01.110
from people purporting to

00:06:01.110 --> 00:06:04.790
be high-level government
officials, revealing secrets,

00:06:04.790 --> 00:06:07.930
and the QAnon account was one of them.

00:06:07.930 --> 00:06:09.070
There was an FBIAnon,

00:06:09.070 --> 00:06:10.700
there was a CIAAnon,

00:06:10.700 --> 00:06:12.580
and for whatever reason,

00:06:12.580 --> 00:06:15.020
this is the one that took off.

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:16.810
This is a movement where
you get information,

00:06:16.810 --> 00:06:17.840
that's all it is.

00:06:17.840 --> 00:06:20.900
It's up to you how you want
to take it, follow the plan,

00:06:20.900 --> 00:06:22.350
trust the plan, the great awakening.

00:06:22.350 --> 00:06:23.183
Yeah.

00:06:23.183 --> 00:06:24.330
You know, there's a lot of reasons why

00:06:24.330 --> 00:06:26.410
someone might believe in QAnon.

00:06:26.410 --> 00:06:27.550
It actually, you know,

00:06:27.550 --> 00:06:29.930
is why people believe in
conspiracies in general.

00:06:29.930 --> 00:06:31.510
I think now more than ever,

00:06:31.510 --> 00:06:34.550
there's kind of distrust in the media,

00:06:34.550 --> 00:06:36.830
in this shared set of facts.

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:37.940
It's all about control.

00:06:37.940 --> 00:06:38.883
Look at the science,

00:06:38.883 --> 00:06:40.570
show me the science with a mask.

00:06:40.570 --> 00:06:41.520
Because I show you science

00:06:41.520 --> 00:06:43.050
the virus goes right through the mask.

00:06:43.050 --> 00:06:46.300
The coronavirus probably
drove people deeper

00:06:46.300 --> 00:06:48.670
into their kind of silos and their holes.

00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:51.250
Many of the followers will
sometimes talk about how they've

00:06:51.250 --> 00:06:53.740
been alienated from
their friends and family.

00:06:53.740 --> 00:06:54.610
But they'll say,

00:06:54.610 --> 00:06:56.273
you know, I have my Q family.

00:06:57.410 --> 00:07:02.050
There are a handful of Q
aggregators, including QMAP,

00:07:02.050 --> 00:07:06.260
which have taken the Q drops
and posted them in more

00:07:06.260 --> 00:07:08.220
friendly web environments,

00:07:08.220 --> 00:07:12.470
devoid of some of the pornography
and other things that are

00:07:12.470 --> 00:07:15.420
on the websites where
the original Q drops are.

00:07:15.420 --> 00:07:17.983
So QMAP was started in April 2018.

00:07:17.983 --> 00:07:20.410
What QMAP did that was so interesting

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:21.940
was that it took it one step further.

00:07:21.940 --> 00:07:24.110
Not only did it aggregate the posts,

00:07:24.110 --> 00:07:26.980
it also kind of wrote out
these themes and players.

00:07:26.980 --> 00:07:29.520
So, it was really easy to navigate.

00:07:29.520 --> 00:07:31.920
And this to me was one of
the biggest revelations

00:07:31.920 --> 00:07:33.370
in my reporting.

00:07:33.370 --> 00:07:37.330
When we found deleted
posts from Jason Gelinas

00:07:37.330 --> 00:07:39.600
where he explained on Twitter,

00:07:39.600 --> 00:07:42.530
how he designed the site like
this intentionally to make it

00:07:42.530 --> 00:07:45.970
as accessible to as many people
as possible, as he called it,

00:07:45.970 --> 00:07:49.430
he was "onboarding normies
into the conspiracy."

00:07:49.430 --> 00:07:51.540
You know, if you wanted
to read more about this

00:07:51.540 --> 00:07:54.210
secret pedophile cabal, great.

00:07:54.210 --> 00:07:57.550
Or if you want to read about
the secret plot to take down

00:07:57.550 --> 00:07:58.730
Mike Flynn, for example,

00:07:58.730 --> 00:08:00.950
Trump's former national
security advisor, boom.

00:08:00.950 --> 00:08:03.550
There's a theme you can go
to and read all about it.

00:08:06.850 --> 00:08:07.683
In recent weeks,

00:08:07.683 --> 00:08:11.970
two researchers at this startup
in the UK called Logically

00:08:11.970 --> 00:08:15.480
publish this really interesting
and fascinating report that

00:08:15.480 --> 00:08:19.810
outed Jason as the person behind QMAP.

00:08:19.810 --> 00:08:26.880
So Logically.ai is a small
operation that looks to expose

00:08:26.880 --> 00:08:31.880
disinformation through
basically internet forensics.

00:08:32.180 --> 00:08:34.620
We use a lot of data streams,

00:08:34.620 --> 00:08:37.180
it's then up to us as the investigators

00:08:37.180 --> 00:08:39.790
and the users to pair
that information down,

00:08:39.790 --> 00:08:42.210
look for trends, look for patterns.

00:08:42.210 --> 00:08:44.650
My name is Joe Ondrak.

00:08:44.650 --> 00:08:49.650
I am the senior investigator
at Logically.ai.

00:08:49.800 --> 00:08:53.060
We are primarily a
fact-checking company,

00:08:53.060 --> 00:08:56.440
but we also do investigations
and editorial into

00:08:56.440 --> 00:08:59.510
disinformation and misinformation online.

00:08:59.510 --> 00:09:03.060
And they began looking into
QMAP in the late summer

00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:04.680
because they felt like it was a way

00:09:04.680 --> 00:09:06.790
that people were becoming radicalized

00:09:06.790 --> 00:09:09.670
and wanted to figure
out who was behind it.

00:09:09.670 --> 00:09:12.940
There was a URL with
an email address in it.

00:09:12.940 --> 00:09:15.770
And from there, we were
able to find Google Chrome

00:09:15.770 --> 00:09:18.730
store page for QMAP.pub.

00:09:18.730 --> 00:09:22.240
And the QMAP app that he was
running that had since been

00:09:22.240 --> 00:09:24.260
deleted by Google Play,

00:09:24.260 --> 00:09:25.370
when they realized they were

00:09:25.370 --> 00:09:27.020
starting to crack down on QAnon.

00:09:27.020 --> 00:09:28.670
Because he was monetizing these apps,

00:09:28.670 --> 00:09:31.350
he had to register them under
a company which led us to

00:09:31.350 --> 00:09:33.150
Patriot Platforms LLC.

00:09:33.150 --> 00:09:35.190
And obviously if he'd
registered for an LLC,

00:09:35.190 --> 00:09:38.000
there would be filings with
names attached to it that we

00:09:38.000 --> 00:09:39.020
could then explore.

00:09:39.020 --> 00:09:41.690
So we pursued open business records,

00:09:41.690 --> 00:09:42.523
we looked at those,

00:09:42.523 --> 00:09:45.140
which gave us the name, Jason Gelinas.

00:09:45.140 --> 00:09:48.790
I saw the report, I was like,
this is really interesting.

00:09:48.790 --> 00:09:51.010
I mean, this is fascinating, but you know,

00:09:51.010 --> 00:09:53.520
they hadn't gone to Jason
for comment, you know,

00:09:53.520 --> 00:09:55.120
it was kind of just put
out there on the website.

00:09:55.120 --> 00:09:57.820
The first thing I did was, I
rented a car and I drove out to

00:09:57.820 --> 00:10:01.313
New Jersey and I found
Jason in his front yard.

00:10:02.150 --> 00:10:06.570
He was holding a wheelbarrow
while some landscapers and

00:10:06.570 --> 00:10:08.740
laborers around him were
doing work on the hedges

00:10:08.740 --> 00:10:09.650
and the lawn,

00:10:09.650 --> 00:10:11.440
and I felt really nervous.

00:10:11.440 --> 00:10:13.730
I walked over and I said "Hi, Jason,

00:10:13.730 --> 00:10:15.120
I'm a reporter from Bloomberg.

00:10:15.120 --> 00:10:16.790
Just wanted to ask you about this report

00:10:16.790 --> 00:10:19.880
that's been published that
says, that you run this website?"

00:10:19.880 --> 00:10:21.180
He was a little evasive.

00:10:21.180 --> 00:10:23.930
He kind of walked away from me
and I was able to kind of get

00:10:23.930 --> 00:10:25.690
him to continue talking, but you know,

00:10:25.690 --> 00:10:27.020
never denied running the site.

00:10:27.020 --> 00:10:29.620
And eventually said that QMAP
was a patriotic movement to

00:10:29.620 --> 00:10:30.810
save the country.

00:10:30.810 --> 00:10:33.010
You know, eventually his wife
appeared to the front door

00:10:33.010 --> 00:10:35.160
who kind of beckoned him inside.

00:10:35.160 --> 00:10:37.110
I went and knocked on
his door a second time,

00:10:37.110 --> 00:10:39.910
really in the effort to try and
give him as much opportunity

00:10:39.910 --> 00:10:41.530
to comment or clarify as possible.

00:10:41.530 --> 00:10:44.650
He didn't respond, once I was in my car,

00:10:44.650 --> 00:10:45.890
multiple police SUV's

00:10:45.890 --> 00:10:49.333
arrived and informed me that
Jason had called the police.

00:10:51.700 --> 00:10:53.910
Once Jason knew he was found out,

00:10:53.910 --> 00:10:58.270
he took down his entire
online presence as well as his

00:10:58.270 --> 00:11:01.200
wife's online presence and pretty much

00:11:01.200 --> 00:11:02.990
disappeared from the internet.

00:11:02.990 --> 00:11:08.420
QMAP.pub also came down and
was basically just a couple of

00:11:08.420 --> 00:11:11.516
links to other QAnon aggregators.

00:11:12.240 --> 00:11:13.540
After our first article that came out

00:11:13.540 --> 00:11:14.740
that noted Jason was an employee

00:11:14.740 --> 00:11:17.483
at Citigroup, the company
placed him on paid leave.

00:11:18.550 --> 00:11:20.340
It's unclear where Jason is now,

00:11:20.340 --> 00:11:23.490
but Citi actually fired
Jason Gelinas after

00:11:23.490 --> 00:11:26.260
almost 13 years at
the company.

00:11:26.260 --> 00:11:28.480
The reason they gave for
firing him is that, you know,

00:11:28.480 --> 00:11:30.590
working at Citi is a really
highly regulated place.

00:11:30.590 --> 00:11:32.650
And you have to disclose
to the company, your,

00:11:32.650 --> 00:11:33.950
your income outside.

00:11:33.950 --> 00:11:35.510
And, you know, he was in theory,

00:11:35.510 --> 00:11:38.507
making money off this QAnon website off Patreon,

00:11:38.507 --> 00:11:40.230
and he never disclosed that to his company.

00:11:42.483 --> 00:11:44.920
QMAP coming down will probably not

00:11:44.920 --> 00:11:49.154
have a huge impact on the viability of

00:11:49.154 --> 00:11:51.020
the QAnon community.

00:11:51.020 --> 00:11:51.853
At this point,

00:11:51.853 --> 00:11:54.820
it is large enough to be pretty adaptable.

00:11:54.820 --> 00:11:57.940
You've seen it pop up
in many places overseas,

00:11:57.940 --> 00:12:02.940
and it really serves as a sort
of proxy for extreme distrust

00:12:03.220 --> 00:12:05.210
of any institutions.

00:12:05.210 --> 00:12:08.020
And Q has served as a
pretty effective vehicle

00:12:08.020 --> 00:12:09.510
for that kind of feeling.

00:12:09.510 --> 00:12:12.540
"I stand before you tonight,
honored by your support."

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:15.940
I think it kind of goes back
to this idea that people are

00:12:15.940 --> 00:12:19.930
disillusioned with kind of
what's happening in the world

00:12:19.930 --> 00:12:22.180
that are more likely to
believe conspiracy theories.

00:12:22.180 --> 00:12:23.730
I think that's what makes Q appealing.

00:12:23.730 --> 00:12:26.337
It's finally an answer to
all of the weird and strange

00:12:26.337 --> 00:12:28.287
things that are happening in the world.

